LongBanana headless model router

Anthropic/Gemini conversion and shadow-replay design adapted from CC Switch
v3.20.4, source commit 9399411 (farion1231/cc-switch):
src-tauri/src/proxy/providers/transform_gemini.rs
src-tauri/src/proxy/providers/gemini_schema.rs
src-tauri/src/proxy/providers/streaming_gemini.rs
This is a Python adaptation, not the upstream desktop executable. Responses
support is a LongBanana extension, not a claim of upstream Gemini support.

